      #text(weight: "bold", fill: rgb("9f1239"), size: 8.5pt)[🇹🇷 MÜLAKAT TUZAĞI VE ANTİ-PATTERN]\
      #v(2pt)
      Saga kurgulanırken Outbox bağımlılıklarını tek noktadan senkron (blocking) olarak çağırmak en yaygın mülakat tuzağıdır! Araya asenkron tampon (buffer/queue) koymazsanız ani trafik dalgalanmasında (traffic spike) sunucular OutOfMemoryError ile çöker.
    ],
    [
      #text(weight: "bold", fill: rgb("be123c"), size: 8.5pt)[🇬🇧 INTERVIEW TRAP & ANTI-PATTERN]\
      #v(2pt)
      #text(fill: rgb("881337"))[Coupling Saga logic directly to synchronous blocking calls into Outbox is a fatal interview anti-pattern! Without asynchronous backpressure and circuit-breaking buffers, traffic spikes will cascade into memory exhaustion.]
    ]
  )
]

